# The Netty harness's B3 configuration (hypotheses.md, Appendix B; WL7), rendered by
# bench/competitors/competitors.py: the cases configuration with WL7's limits and the 60 s timer.
# One argument and its value per line; the JVM's flags are bench/competitors/jvm.args.
--port @PORT@
# No PROXY listener: B3's openings send no PROXY header, and the window reads one listener.
# Every detection timer at 60 s (section 1): ReadTimeoutHandler and SniHandler's handshake timeout.
--timer-s @TIMER_S@
# Appendix B: ChannelOption.SO_BACKLOG at N_PEND (Netty's default, NetUtil.SOMAXCONN, reads
# /proc/sys/net/core/somaxconn).
--backlog @N_PEND@
--cert @REPO@/tests/fixtures/tls/test-cert.pem
--key @REPO@/tests/fixtures/tls/test-key.pem
